---
import SectionTitle from "@/components/shared/section-title.astro"
import PartnerCard from "./partner-card.astro"
import { Separator } from "../ui/separator"
---

<section class="flex w-full justify-center bg-red-50 px-4 xl:rounded-br-4xl xl:rounded-bl-4xl">
  <div class="flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-1 flex-col py-16 lg:py-26 2xl:max-w-7xl">
    <SectionTitle
      title="Collaborating for Global Impact"
      subtitle="OUR PARTNERS"
      description="Meet the forward-thinking organizations and health-tech leaders whose support empowers us to bridge the gap between biomedical research and real-world clinical solutions."
    />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10">
      <div></div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
        <PartnerCard title="İstanbul Gelişim Üniversitesi" image="/assets/images/gelisim.png">
          <p>
            İstanbul Gelişim Üniversitesi (IGU), established in 2008 and located in the vibrant city of Istanbul, Türkiye, is a leading higher
            education institution renowned for its rapid growth and strong commitment to internationalization. Strategically situated at the
            crossroads of Europe and Asia, IGU has positioned itself as a global hub for academic excellence and innovation. As a testament to its
            world-class standards, IGU was the only Turkish university to reach the finals for the "Best Internationalization Strategy" at the Times
            Higher Education (THE) Asia Awards in 2019, often referred to as the "Oscars of Higher Education." This recognition highlights the
            university’s visionary approach to global scholarship and its success in fostering a multicultural academic environment.
          </p>

          <p>
            With an extensive global network, IGU maintains exchange programs with over 155 universities under the Erasmus+ framework and holds
            academic cooperation agreements with 33 prestigious institutions worldwide. The university is dedicated to producing graduates who possess
            a global perspective, supported by high-quality research facilities and a safe, dynamic campus life in the heart of Turkey’s financial and
            commercial center.
          </p>

          <p>
            By serving as a co-host for this conference, İstanbul Gelişim Üniversitesi continues its mission to bridge continents and disciplines,
            facilitating high-level intellectual exchange and driving purposeful action toward global sustainable development.
          </p>
        </PartnerCard>

        <Separator />

        <PartnerCard title="Nutral" image="/assets/images/nutral.jpg">
          <p>
            Nutral.id, based in Sukabumi and associated with Nusa Putra University, focuses on connecting higher education with industry to boost
            employability, drive innovation, and solve real-world challenges.
          </p>

          <p>
            The organization provides key academic services, including scholarly publishing through the Nutral Academy Publisher and end-to-end
            conference management, frequently hosting global events for researchers and professionals.
          </p>

          <p>
            Additionally, Nutral partners with various institutions and businesses to co-host events, publish special research issues, and create
            custom training programs that empower the academic community.
          </p>
        </PartnerCard>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
